Let coffee beans be $12.50.
Let mug be $8.
Let filter papers be $3.20.

Keep asking which item I want, then how many of them, until the item is "done".

If the item is not on the list, tell me it isn't on the list and ask again.

When the item is "done":
    Show the total.
    If the total is over $50, show the total minus 10%.
